gqna","author":"Bharat","handle":"@Bharat","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-10-18T09:21:43.211Z","text":"Jio IPO and Akash Ambani’s bigger tech ambitions beyond telecom — 5G consume lot of data even if you just check internet speed so everyone has to give unlimited data on 5G plans. Before 5G, in US you still only get 1 GB data per month on 4G plans and in India we are getting 1 GB per day on 4G. if there were no jio no one would have thought about giving these much data with only 150 to 300 rupees. everyone was charging per GB not unlimited data with 1 GB per day high speed with restrictions. Its like how zerodha introduced flat fee per order.","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/jio-ipo-and-akash-ambani-s-bigger-tech-ambitions-beyond-telecom/198906/5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:30.575Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-25T23:16:15.747Z"},{"id":"tradingqna-tqna-543462","source":"tradingqna","author":"saiu","handle":"@saiu","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-10-18T09:01:16.451Z","text":"Jio IPO and Akash Ambani’s bigger tech ambitions beyond telecom — What’s a concrete thing they plan to do in tech (other than mobile and internet services)?","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/jio-ipo-and-akash-ambani-s-bigger-tech-ambitions-beyond-telecom/198906/4","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:30.575Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-25T23:16:15.747Z"},{"id":"tradingqna-tqna-543461","source":"tradingqna","author":"BB789","handle":"@BB789","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-10-18T08:56:50.085Z","text":"Jio IPO and Akash Ambani’s bigger tech ambitions beyond telecom — Would it not have happened without Jio? 4G was coming anyway and competition would’ve reduced prices anyway. Furthermore, the effects of duopoly is still unfolding. Long term effects are yet to be seen. Big IPO exits rarely end up good for the markets or the economy in the immediate future. Not listing, but f(x) = min (Jio IPO start date, Nifty touches upper Bollinger band)","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/jio-ipo-and-akash-ambani-s-bigger-tech-ambitions-beyond-telecom/198906/3","sentiment":"bullish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:30.575Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-25T23:16:15.747Z"},{"id":"tradingqna-tqna-543458","source":"tradingqna","author":"cvs","handle":"@cvs","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-10-18T08:10:55.551Z","text":"Jio IPO and Akash Ambani’s bigger tech ambitions beyond telecom — Sounds like a concerning dystopia. The next version of slavery/indentured labor, and in more recent times, company towns and scrips. Feel significantly worse than the current equilibrium of the “illusion of individual freedom/choice” with almost all fronts ending-up leading to a handful of mega-corporations. Hopefully, it doesn’t come to that.","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/jio-ipo-and-akash-ambani-s-bigger-tech-ambitions-beyond-telecom/198906/2","sentiment":"neutral","likes":1,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:30.575Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-25T23:16:15.747Z"},{"id":"tradingqna-tqna-543456","source":"tradingqna","author":"bearishbhaiya","handle":"@bearishbhaiya","community":"TradingQnA","timestamp":"2026-10-18T07:58:56.249Z","text":"Jio IPO and Akash Ambani’s bigger tech ambitions beyond telecom — I dunno, but the more I think about Jio IPO, the more interesting it gets. Reliance made internet cheap and everything changed, how India uses internet. And now look at the kind of businesses that have been built because of that. If you check Akash’s IPO presentation, Jio clearly wants to be seen as a tech company, not a telecom operator. The valuation is around 10.3 lakh crore, nearly 75% of RIL’s market cap. See, Jio already have 50cr plus users, connectivity, broadband, cloud, AI, devices, entertainment etc. My guess is Jio w…","url":"https://tradingqna.com/t/jio-ipo-and-akash-ambani-s-bigger-tech-ambitions-beyond-telecom/198906/1","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":2,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-18T11:43:30.575Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-25T23:16:15.747Z"},{"id":"news-gn-MGxZZXh3aUt3Q2FvUE9pUjVaRmxuTkc4","source":"news","author":"TelecomTalk","handle":"TelecomTalk","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-10-16T17:48:34.000Z","text":"Jio IPO: How to Apply, Check Eligibility and Get Share Allotment","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQbmctTDAxRDlSbnZzdllNd2hLRFc1aFY4N3hVWkN6MElzSGxwc3NnZU54d195M0gwb3hjT01TdUZLZFExUE5YTllueEM2eGVuYUpRakNwY3VYTk96WmQwZTNnRVVQNTE5YkJ2ZGxjNjlabE1SeHRxOUhRMmdPWFJGMGxZZXh3aUt3Q2FvUE9pUjVaRmxuTkc4?oc=5","sentiment":"neutral","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-17T13:13:01.719Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-17T13:13:01.719Z"},{"id":"news-gn-UXlsT2ZLMlZna3ZGQXVRYlZEYmFaZmlB","source":"news","author":"Livemint","handle":"Livemint","community":"Google News","timestamp":"2026-10-16T05:31:04.000Z","text":"Jio IPO impact bubble over? Reliance shares down 2.5% after rising 5% in 3 days; should you buy Mukesh Ambani stock?","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","sentiment":"bullish","likes":0,"comments":0,"firstSeenAt":"2026-10-17T13:13:01.719Z","lastSeenAt":"2026-10-19T00:30:50.204Z"}],"generatedAt":"2026-10-25T23:16:15.747Z"}
